0,1078000,1736000,582900,407900,1017300,1463000,77900,284800,1107300,124600,109000,742400,272500,678400,566900,420300,164200,225100,537200,1351600,7005700,73057200,6086300,3275600,2234500,1523500,2700100,130900,2955900,1694600,1042800,345200,1232800]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.plsplantations.my","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","employees":null,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"PLS Plantations Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the management and operation of forest and oil palm plantation in Malaysia and the Republic of China. It operates through the Plantation, Trading, and Agricultural Services segments. The company is involved in the management and operation of forest plantation, logging, saw milling, chipping, and other downstream manufacturing and related activities, as well as oil palm and rubber plantation; and management, operation, maintenance, and harvesting of durian, banana, and pineapple plantations, including contract farming and other durian related businesses; and manufacturing, production, trading, marketing, and export of biomass wood pellets. It also engages in trading fresh and processed fruits, and timber products; retail business; and development and maintenance work in relation to agricultural activities; undertaking construction work; and trading of food and beverages. In addition, the company is involved in the civil engineering and construction works; trading on products for wood-based manufacturing industries; wholesaling of bananas; packaging, trading, export, and wholesaling of pineapples; wholesaling of durian; carrying out part of the forestry and forest plantation operation on a fee or contract basis for forestry service activities; and manufacture of wooden and cane furniture to export wood related products business. The company was formerly known as Pembinaan Limbongan Setia Berhad and changed its name to PLS Plantations Berhad in October 2009. PLS Plantations Berhad was incorporated in 1987 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. PLS Plantations Berhad operates as a subsidiary of Ekovest Berhad.","zh":"PLS Plantations Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚和中国管理和运营森林及油棕种植园。公司成立于1987年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，是Ekovest Berhad的子公司。公司通过种植、贸易和农业服务三个部门运营。","lines":["种植业务：管理和运营森林种植园、伐木、锯木、削片及其他下游制造活动，以及油棕和橡胶种植园。","农业服务：管理和运营榴莲、香蕉和菠萝种植园，包括合同农业和其他榴莲相关业务，并提供农业活动的开发与维护服务。","生物质木颗粒：制造、生产、贸易、营销和出口生物质木颗粒。","贸易业务：贸易新鲜和加工水果、木材产品、食品和饮料，以及香蕉、菠萝和榴莲的批发。","其他业务：包括土木工程和建筑、零售业务、木制家具制造，以及为林业服务活动提供收费或合同服务。"],"lines_en":["Plantation: Management and operation of forest and oil palm plantations, logging, saw milling, chipping, and other downstream manufacturing activities, as well as rubber plantation.","Agricultural Services: Management, operation, maintenance, and harvesting of durian, banana, and pineapple plantations, including contract farming and other durian related businesses, and development and maintenance work for agricultural activities.","Biomass Wood Pellets: Manufacturing, production, trading, marketing, and export of biomass wood pellets.","Trading: Trading of fresh and processed fruits, timber products, food and beverages, and wholesaling of bananas, pineapples, and durian.","Others: Includes civil engineering and construction works, retail business, manufacture of wooden and cane furniture, and forestry service activities on a fee or contract basis."]}}